worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_concept_queries_and_arithmetic.js"
  ceiling 1214
  rationale "Concept and how-it-works query extraction, then the arithmetic tokenizer, currency and percent expressions and the exact arithmetic evaluator. Issue #658 cut this module out of one oversized worker file by line count; R1188-U5 named it after what it holds. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling 1224 (2026-10-07, R1017): the fallback evaluator applies a seeded math function to a parenthesized argument (applyMathFunction, keyed by the math_function_name meaning slug), the twin of link-calculator's sqrt/sin/ln support on the native path. Ceiling 1227 (2026-10-07, #1175 routing probes): normalizeArithmeticWords splits a CJK operator surface glued onto its operands ('12乘以7') so the token map reads it. Lowered to 1212 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): the inverted-who frame, meaning-question leads and tails, non-subject words and idiom tails are seed cue records read through conceptQueryCues. Ceiling moved 1212 to 1214 (R1188-U5): the first comment lines say what the module holds."
